  \par

Los foros y el grupo antiguos pasan a ser de solo lectura:\par

  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK https://sourceforge.net/p/keynote-newfeat/discussion/ }}{\fldrslt{https://sourceforge.net/p/keynote-newfeat/discussion/}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

  {{\cf0\ul{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK http://groups.google.com/group/keynote-nf }}{\fldrslt{http://groups.google.com/group/keynote-nf}}}}}\f0\fs20\par

\par

\par


\pard\sa120\cf1\b\fs24 29 dic 2008  (Versi\u243?n: 1.7.4)\par


\pard\cf0\b0\fs20 A partir de la versi\u243?n 1.7.4 el programa pasa a llamarse \b \u171?KeyNote NF\u187?\b0\par

